1. Cut milk tea to twice a week;
2. Move dinner earlier to before 19:00;
3. Run or do yoga three times a week;
4. Go to bed before 23:00;
5. Give up the afternoon sugar-free latte.
Note: Set a phone reminder for each item.

Five core draft points:
1. Publicly announce all staff tasks every Monday;
2. Set up an anonymous feedback email;
3. Conduct a satisfaction survey every six months;
4. Assign tasks based on public rules;
5. Hold a monthly review meeting to discuss improvements.
